            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f2" n="2" xml:id="d289-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d283">Document 283</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f3" n="3" xml:id="d289-f3-content">
                <p>These assurances were contained in an October 13 note. (Johnson Library, National
                    Security File, Country File, Vietnam, 5 D (2), Allies Troop Commitments and
                    Other Aid, 1967–1969)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f4" n="4" xml:id="d289-f4-content">
                <p>This note is dated October 17. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d289-f5" n="5" xml:id="d289-f5-content">
                <p> Rusk informed Ambassador Ong in an October 27 letter that he had conveyed the
                    Prime Minister’s assurances.</p>
            </note>
